        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Plasma weapon, raygun\n- Concepts: Plasma, science fiction, plasma generation\n- Topics: Physics, weapons in fiction\n\nFacts:\n- In science fiction, a plasma weapon is a type of raygun.\n- A plasma weapon fires a stream, bolts, a pulse, or a toroid of plasma.\n- Plasma is very hot, very energetic excited matter.\n- In physics, plasma can be generated by heating neutral gases.\n- In physics, plasma can also be generated by subjecting gas to a strong electromagnetic field.",
